<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.6500 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.6500 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.6500 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6575 on Mar 18.</p>
<p>				    Mar 20	   Mar 18</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6500	   4.6575</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    900,000	  550,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
